 `CustomerRepository` deliberately behaves like a real paged backend: it refuses
 to return more than `MAX_PAGE_SIZE` (200) rows in a single call. Callers page.

+## Filtering
+
+The filter bar above the grid narrows the list by name and by status. Both are
+applied by the repository, so the grid still loads one page at a time and counts
+the matching rows with a query. The name is split into words, and each word must
+appear in the first or last name, ignoring case and accents. The filter is kept
+in the URL as `name` and `status` query parameters, for example
+`/?name=vir&status=ACTIVE,CLOSED`, so a filtered list can be bookmarked or shared.
+
